WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
This is the capstone. Everything we've covered comes together here.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Program completion and graduation. Review of credentials earned: EPA 608
Universal, OSHA 10-Hour, CPR/AED. Review of training hours completed (480+).
Distribution of completion certificates. Career services introduction and job

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: You are now a credentialed HVAC technician.
Your next step is OJT placement with a licensed company.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Verify all credentials are in hand. And — Connect with
career services

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Take a minute before you move on. What's the one thing from this lesson you need
to remember on a service call?

